# Vercel Ignore File

# Legacy HTML files (not used in Next.js app)
*.html
!public/**/*.html

# NOTE: Do not ignore `public/assets/` — Next.js serves /assets/* from there.
# A bare `assets/` pattern was excluding public/assets on Vercel (404 for card-bg.png).

# Development files
node_modules
.git
.vscode
.idea

# Test files
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.spec.ts
*.spec.tsx

# Documentation
README.md

